{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21990","headline":"续古诗十首 六 · 白居易","name":"续古诗十首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栖栖远方士，读书三十年。\n业成无知己，徒步来入关。\n长安多王候，英俊竞攀援。\n幸随衆宾末，得厠门馆间。\n东合有旨酒，中堂有管弦。\n何爲向隅客，对此不开颜。\n富贵无是非，主人终日欢。\n贫贱多悔尤，客子中夜叹。\n归去复归去，故乡贫亦安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21990.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21990","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}